# EVERYTHING IS HARDCODED — this file is optional. Deploy = add files + Restart.
# The panel listens on 0.0.0.0:25811 AND the host's SERVER_PORT/PORT.
# Chromium comes from the bundled @sparticuz/chromium npm package (no download,
# no apt). Cookies are read from downloader/cookies.txt when present.
#
# Only set any of these if you want to override a hardcoded default:

# Leave empty for an open panel. The dashboard sends this same key.
# PANEL_KEY=

# Browser CORS origin (only needed if a browser on another domain calls the
# panel directly). The dashboard proxies server-side, so this is normally empty.
# PANEL_ORIGIN=

# Optional: point the panel at your own Chromium binary instead of the bundle.
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE=

# Optional: your own Scribd session cookies (only download what you may save).
# SCRIBD_COOKIES=
